---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for Summit Ledger Books. Learn how I collect, use, and protect your information.">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="section-heading">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">Last updated: March 4, 2025</p>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>Summit Ledger Books ("I," "me," or "my") operates summitledgerbooks.com. This page explains what information I collect when you visit my site, how I use it, and your rights regarding that information.</p>

      <h2>Information I Collect</h2>

      <h3>Analytics Data</h3>
      <p>I use Google Analytics 4 to understand how visitors use my site. Google Analytics collects information such as pages visited, time spent on the site, general geographic location (country/city level), device and browser type, and how you arrived at my site. This data is aggregated and does not personally identify you. You can opt out of Google Analytics tracking by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>

      <h3>Contact Form</h3>
      <p>When you submit my contact form, I collect your name, email address, and any information you include in your message. I use this solely to respond to your inquiry.</p>

      <h3>Scheduling</h3>
      <p>If you book a consultation through Calendly, that information is collected and stored by Calendly under their own privacy policy. I receive your name, email, and any notes you provide in order to prepare for the call.</p>

      <h2>How I Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to inquiries and schedule consultations</li>
        <li>To understand how my website is being used so I can improve it</li>
        <li>To communicate with you about my services if you have requested information</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>Google Analytics sets cookies in your browser to track sessions and distinguish users. These are analytical cookies and do not contain personally identifiable information. You can control cookies through your browser settings or opt out via the link above.</p>

      <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
      <p>I do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes. Information may be shared only with service providers that help me operate the site (such as Google Analytics and Calendly), and only to the extent necessary to provide those services.</p>

      <h2>Data Retention</h2>
      <p>Contact form submissions are retained only as long as needed to respond to your inquiry. Analytics data is retained according to Google Analytics' default retention settings.</p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of any personal information you have provided to me. To make such a request, contact me at <a href="mailto:austin@summitledgerbooks.com">austin@summitledgerbooks.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>External Links</h2>
      <p>My site contains links to external sites (such as Calendly and LinkedIn). I am not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites and encourage you to review their policies.</p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>I may update this privacy policy from time to time. The "last updated" date at the top of this page will reflect any changes. Continued use of the site after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the updated policy.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, reach out at <a href="mailto:austin@summitledgerbooks.com">austin@summitledgerbooks.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+13854502276">385-450-2276</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
